<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS5.SSS1" title="In A.5 Remarks on dLLM inference ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Principled and Tractable RL for Reasoning with Diffusion Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5.1 </span>Instruct-tuned models</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS5.SSS2" title="In A.5 Remarks on dLLM inference ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Principled and Tractable RL for Reasoning with Diffusion Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5.2 </span>Bidirectional prompting</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS5.SSS3" title="In A.5 Remarks on dLLM inference ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Principled and Tractable RL for Reasoning with Diffusion Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5.3 </span>KV caching</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
